026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[67,23,78,65,46,45],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018705","helmet":"WP1027705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,23,78,65,46,45],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018705","helmet":"WP1027705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,23,78,65,46,45],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018705","helmet":"WP1027705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,23,78,65,46,45],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018705","helmet":"WP1027705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏术士，为人心宽随性，经常以德报怨。管辂童年时期便开始研究星相，成年后更是精通《易经》、占卜、算学、甚至是鸟语、生死，管辂也因此被曹操招来占卜，并预言了刘备的战略、夏侯渊战死、许昌大火等事，皆成现实。","tc":"曹魏術士，為人心寬隨性，經常以德報怨。管輅童年時期便開始研究星相，成年后更是精通《易經》、占卜、算學、甚至是鳥語、生死，管輅也因此被曹操招來占卜，并預言了劉備的戰略、夏侯淵戰死、許昌大火等事，皆成現實。","en":"A diviner of Cao Wei, known for his magnanimous and easygoing nature, often repaying grievance with kindness. Guan Lu began studying celestial phenomena as a child and in adulthood mastered the Classic of Changes, divination, mathematics, and even the language of birds and matters of life and death. His reputation led Cao Cao to summon him for divination, and his predictions regarding Liu Bei's strategy, Xiahou Yuan's death in battle, and a great fire in Xuchang all came to pass.","jp":"曹魏の術士。人となりは寛大で気まま、常に徳を以て怨みに報いた。管輅は幼少期より星相を研究し始め、成人後は『易経』、卜占、算術、さらには鳥語や死生にまで精通した。そのため曹操に招かれて占術を行うと、劉備の戦略、夏侯淵の戦死、許昌の大火などを予言し、それらはことごとく現実となった。","kr":"조위의 술사로, 성품이 너그럽고 소탈하여 늘 덕으로 원한을 갚았다. 관로는 어린 시절부터 성상을 연구하기 시작해 성인이 된 후에는 《역경》, 점술, 산학은 물론 새의 언어와 생사의 이치에까지 두루 정통했다. 이로 인해 조조에게 불려 가 점을 치게 되었는데, 유비의 전략, 하후연의 전사, 허창의 대화재 등을 예언하였으며 이는 모두 현실이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10886","remark":"","surname":"管","surnameTc":"管","surnameEn":"Guan","surnameJp":"管","surnameKr":"관","surnameOther":"","name":"辂","nameTc":"輅","nameEn":"Lu","nameJp":"輅","nameKr":"로","nameOther":"","word":"公明","wordTc":"公明","wordEn":"Gongming","wordJp":"公明","wordKr":"공명","wordOther":"","icon":"管辂","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"248","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"23","wise":"78","politics":"65","charm":"46","will":"45","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"6/6/6/6/6/76/21/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1009302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1001205","warSoulPoint":"4500","battleSoulPoint":"500","debateSoulPoint":"6100","strategy":"","strategy2":"1003615","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/2/2/0/1/0/0/0/0/2/2/2/3/0/0/0/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"2","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"209","show":"238","death":"256","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"5","weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018705","helmet":"WP1027705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"8/1;12/1;19/1;